c4 Pirate Treasure Map System

Captain is a person
  -Plots the next raid-> TreasureMap

TreasureMap is a system description: Tracks buried treasure locations

  containers
    ChartRoom is a container description: Interactive sea chart, tech: Parchment
      -Queries treasure data-> Vault

    Vault is a container description: Encrypted treasure ledger, tech: Iron Chest
